# fog_bank.fmat — a volume's fog, as a material.
#
# This was world.VolumeFog, the `fog:` block on a volume. Density is extinction
# per world unit travelled INSIDE the region, so it means the same thing
# whatever size the volume is: the number does not have to be re-tuned when the
# room is.
kind: sky
doc: A haze to fill a room or a doorway with. Max opacity keeps it from hiding what stands in it.
effects:
  - effect: fog
    color: {r: 0.62, g: 0.68, b: 0.76}
    density: 0.22
    max_opacity: 0.85
